    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesnt feel like a symptom. it feels like a fact. i look at my partner and i see how much more they smile when i'm not in the room, or how much better they sleep when i'm not there stressing them out. it's like i'm just this constant weight on their shoulders. if i was gone, they could finally just... breathe. wouldnt that be the kindest thing i could actually do for them?",
